# Browser
# Thousand Moons Smithy's first-main-phase trigger in the browser: the "you may" says what tapping five does, and the choice
# of the five is captioned as a tap by an effect, not a cost, clicked on the battlefield (CR 701.26a). Bot1 taps the Gnome
# Soldier and four Ornithopters, and the Smithy transforms into Barracks of the Thousand. On turn 5 the Barracks' {W} and a
# Plains' {W} are in the pool: the Barracks' is a chip of its own, captioned with where it came from (CR 106.3), which Bot1
# clicks to pay for Healer's Hawk (a Gnome Soldier); the Plains' {W} pays for Authority of the Consuls, making none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Thousand Moons Smithy
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Healer's Hawk
Authority of the Consuls
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Thousand Moons Smithy.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Thousand Moons Smithy: tap five untapped artifacts and/or creatures you control to transform it?
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = You choose the five next; they stay tapped until they untap
Bot1.Accept
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Thousand Moons Smithy: choose 5 permanents to tap
Bot1.Choose(Gnome Soldier Token; Ornithopter#1; Ornithopter#2; Ornithopter#3; Ornithopter#4)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Barracks of the Thousand.Activate
? Client.Bot1.Mana = 1 White; 1 White (from Barracks of the Thousand)
Bot1.Hand.Healer's Hawk.Cast(Spend: W from Barracks of the Thousand)
Bot1.Hand.Authority of the Consuls.Cast
? Stack = Authority of the Consuls
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Authority of the Consuls; Barracks of the Thousand; Gnome Soldier Token; Gnome Soldier Token; Healer's Hawk; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Plains
